Input: {"question": "What is the occupation of Jean-Marie Lenzi?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 213, "text": "As the sun set over the Eiffel Tower, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of Paris, Jean-Marie Lenzi made his way through the crowded café, his worn leather briefcase clutched tightly in his hand."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 214, "end": 355, "text": "The aroma of freshly brewed coffee and buttery croissants wafted through the air, enticing the patrons to linger over their morning routines."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 356, "end": 497, "text": "But Jean-Marie had no time for indulgence; he had a meeting to attend, one that could make or break his career as a militaires du contingent."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 498, "end": 685, "text": "As he pushed open the door, a chorus of bonjours and saluts greeted him, and he nodded curtly in response, his eyes scanning the room for the familiar face of his contact, Colonel Dupont."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 686, "end": 832, "text": "The colonel, a man with a reputation for being as tough as the boots he wore, was already seated at a corner table, sipping a cup of black coffee."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 833, "end": 931, "text": "Jean-Marie slid into the chair across from him, his eyes locking onto the colonel's piercing gaze."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 932, "end": 984, "text": "\"Bonjour, Colonel,\" he said, his voice low and even."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 985, "end": 1037, "text": "\"Lenzi,\" the colonel replied, his voice like gravel."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1038, "end": 1107, "text": "\"I trust you're prepared to discuss the latest developments in our..."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1108, "end": 1121, "text": "arrangement?\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1122, "end": 1201, "text": "Jean-Marie nodded, his mind racing with the implications of their conversation."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1202, "end": 1377, "text": "As a militaires du contingent, he was part of an elite group of French politicians who had served in the military, and his unique perspective was invaluable to the government."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1378, "end": 1519, "text": "But it was a double-edged sword; his military background also made him a target for those who sought to undermine the government's authority."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1520, "end": 1587, "text": "The colonel leaned forward, his eyes glinting with a hint of steel."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1588, "end": 1684, "text": "\"We have reason to believe that a rogue faction within the military is planning to stage a coup."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1685, "end": 1713, "text": "We need someone with your..."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1714, "end": 1778, "text": "particular set of skills to infiltrate and gather intelligence.\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1779, "end": 1846, "text": "Jean-Marie's gut tightened, his mind racing with the possibilities."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1847, "end": 1922, "text": "This was the kind of mission that could make his career, or get him killed."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1923, "end": 2046, "text": "But he knew that he had no choice; as a militaires du contingent, it was his duty to serve his country, no matter the cost."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2047, "end": 2081, "text": "\"I'm in,\" he said, his voice