d exceptional leadership and strategic thinking."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1037, "end": 1196, "text": "\"Jean-Marie Lenzi's experience in senior management roles has equipped him with the skills and knowledge necessary to navigate complex policy issues,\" said Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1197, "end": 1261, "text": "Sophie Dupont, a political scientist at the University of Paris."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1262, "end": 1374, "text": "\"His background as an 'ancien cadre' has undoubtedly influenced his approach to governance and decision-making.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1375, "end": 1518, "text": "A review of Lenzi's public statements and policy initiatives reveals a strong emphasis on economic development, innovation, and social welfare."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1519, "end": 1655, "text": "These priorities are consistent with the values and concerns typically associated with the \"anciens cadres\" socio-professional category."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1656, "end": 1889, "text": "\"Lenzi's commitment to fostering a business-friendly environment and promoting social cohesion reflects his understanding of the needs and challenges faced by French citizens,\" noted Pierre-Henri Dumont, a prominent French economist."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1890, "end": 2031, "text": "\"His experience as an 'ancien cadre' has provided him with a unique perspective on the interplay between economic growth and social welfare.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2032, "end": 2265, "text": "Data from the French Ministry of Labor and Solidarity confirms that individuals classified as \"anciens cadres\" are more likely to hold advanced degrees and have higher average salaries compared to other socio-professional categories."}, "D2S1