and his unique perspective was invaluable to the government.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["militaires du contingent", "anciens cadres"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "militaires du contingent", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "anciens cadres", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
